{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1517903-the-skinner-paragon","id":1517903,"title":"The Skinner (Paragon)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-07-13T14:26:04-07:00","id":1517903,"title":"The Skinner (Paragon)","content":"<i>For the Gods are no strangers to bargains<br /> Traditions with teeth have their time and their place<br /> - Valkyrie Daughter by S.J. Tucker</i><br /> <br /> The girl who would become The Skinner met the god whom she knew as Jacob sometime during her third year as a member of the Pack. She was the Master's first and his favorite and would in a few months be the mother of his child and so she was in charge of dealing with the new Pack members and Jacob was the newest. Not that he was openly a god, Master wouldn't have stood for that, but the girl could tell something was different about him immediately, after all the Master had never taken a boy before, or perhaps it was that he was the only one undisturbed by the half-spirit sisters within the Pack. Whatever it was she was certain enough that she went to him on the third night of his captivity, and her life changed forever.<br /> <br /> A bargain of threes the god Jacob called it, her name, her beauty, and her child in exchange for three wishes. But the girl didn't have three wishes, she had only one, to be as the Master was, so that she could rip his throat out herself. Jacob told her that was beyond his power, he could not make her as the Master was, but that he could give her the power to make herself as the Master was. So it was that the bargain was struck, for her name the girl gained the power to use the true names of the world, for her beauty she gained the power to wear the skins of others, and for her child she gained a magic from another world, a World of Darkness, the god said. Thus The Skinner was born.<br /> <br /> Master was The Skinner's first skin, taken with the silver knife that was her second bargain given form. She called the police and sent them to the Master's after she was well away. The Skinner listened to the police radio after the call, and watched on the news the days after that. There was no report of a boy named Jacob being saved from the Master's. There was, however, a girl who wore The Skinner's old name, who matched The Skinner's old description, who was with child.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Skinner</span><br /> <b>Type:</b> Paragon (Falconian Productions Patreon) (Ceremonial Magician Thaumaturge (Second Sight pg 24) / Skinthief (Borrowed Power pg 14))<br /> <b>Attributes:</b> Intelligence 2, Wits 2, Resolve 4; Strength 2, Dexterity 2, Stamina 2 (8/9/9/8); Presence 2, Manipulation 5, Composure 2<br /> <b>Skills:</b> Athletics 2, Stealth1, Survival 1, Weaponry 4 (knife); Investigation 2, Occult 5 (rituals); Animal Ken 1, Empathy 2 (Fear), Persuasion 4, Subterfuge 2<br /> <b>Merits: </b>Thaumaturgy 3, Skinthief 3, Bare Necessities 3, Multiple Forms 3, Unseen Sense 2 (Werewolves), Assertive Implement 4 (Silver Knife), Mind Control 3, Luck Magic 2, <br /> <b>Arete:</b> 3<br /> <b>Willpower: </b>6<br /> <b>Integrity:</b> 7<br /> <b>Anima/Per Turn: </b>8/1<br /> <b>Health:</b> 7<br /> <b>Initiative Modifier:</b> +4<br /> <b>Defense:</b> 4<br /> <b>Size:</b> 5<br /> <b>Speed:</b> 9<br /> <b>Masteries: </b>Supernatural Sense<br /> <b>Other: </b>Paragon Aura<br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}